            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for ability, then the Marathi for a right."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: साधन",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "साधन — sādhan — \"a means, a tool\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "साधन (sādhan) is Sanskrit sādhana, \"furthering; completion\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 13334). It is built on sādh, \"to accomplish\"."
            }
          ]
        },
